/target/
# Nix writes result, and result-1, result-2 and so on for a build with several
# outputs.
result
result-*
# The links to the crates this builds against are a property of a machine, not
# of the repository. scripts/link-deps.sh makes them.
# Working notes that are not about this code.
/local/
# What the fuzzers write: the inputs they kept, the crashes they found and
# their build tree. A corpus is a machine's working set, not a source file, and
# a crash that matters becomes a test rather than a committed artefact.
/fuzz/corpus/
/fuzz/artifacts/
/fuzz/coverage/
/fuzz/target/
# Lean's build output.
/lean/.lake/
/lean-verified/.lake/
# No secret ever lands here, so the file that usually carries one cannot.
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
._*
/fuzz-*.log
spec/tla2tools.jar
